    "ffer_rule": "candidate common-service efficiency divided by reference common-service efficiency",
    "tolerance_rule": "per segment max(absolute_energy_j, relative_fraction * required_energy_j); a positive demand cannot have allowed deficit greater than or equal to the full demand"
